{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 19, :comments ["<b>And lean of flesh.</b> The sign: דקות and רקות — that which is written רעות is רקות, and the others are דקות, and your sign: רק רע, as written in the pericope of Bereshit."], :book :genesis, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 41, :notes {0 "The note uses mnemonic signs linking the spelling רעות ('lean,' from our verse) with רקות, and the parallel cows (Genesis 41:3, דקות) with דקות; the mnemonic רק רע presumably recalls Genesis 41:4 where both terms appear adjacent."}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:06:52.642829541Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}